	(descr "HiLink HLK-LD2410C 24 GHz mmWave presence radar daughterboard mechanical-reference (no pads). Body 22 x 16 mm, approx 6 mm above the OAS PCB on a 1x5 P2.54 mm gold-pin header (J4). MOUNT ANTENNA-FACE UP, away from the OAS PCB and toward the AK-N-94 perforated cover, so the radar looks into the room; the module then reads Tx/Rx/OUT/GND/VCC from the WEST end of the hole row.")
